$$A_1 = 500000(1 + 0.005) - M = 500000(1.005) - M$$
$$\begin{aligned} A_2 &= A_1(1 + 0.005) - M \\ &= \big(500000(1.005) - M\big)(1.005) - M \\ &= 500000(1.005)^2 - M(1.005) - M \\ &= 500000(1.005)^2 - M(1 + 1.005) \end{aligned}$$','Must start with $A_1$. 1: $A_1 = 500000(1.005) - M$; 1: $A_2 = (500000(1.005) - M)(1.005) - M$',409,NULL,'parse-v1',NULL,NULL,'[[2, "Correct answer"], [1, "Obtains $A_1 = 500000(1.005) - M$, or equivalent merit"]]','{"marker_note": "Must start with $A_1$.", "top_criterion_original": "$A_2 = (500000(1.005) - M)(1.005) - M$", "criteria_original": [[1, "$A_1 = 500000(1.005) - M$"], [1, "Correct answer"]], "rubric_note": "Rewritten top-down from a one-mark-per-step rubric (owner rule, 11 Nov)."}');
$$\begin{aligned} 500000(1.005)^{360} - M\left(\dfrac{1.005^{360} - 1}{0.005}\right) &= 0 \\ 500000(1.005)^{360} - 200M\left(1.005^{360} - 1\right) &= 0 \end{aligned}$$
$$\begin{aligned} M &= \dfrac{500000(1.005)^{360}}{200\left(1.005^{360} - 1\right)} \\ &= 2997.75\ldots \\ &\approx 2998 \end{aligned}$$
$\therefore$ The monthly repayment is $\$2998$.','1: $A_{360} = 0$ equation; 1: expression for $M$',409,NULL,'parse-v1',NULL,NULL,'[[2, "Correct answer"], [1, "Obtains $A_{360} = 0$ equation, or equivalent merit"]]','{"top_criterion_original": "Expression for $M$", "criteria_original": [[1, "$A_{360} = 0$ equation"], [1, "Correct answer"]], "rubric_note": "Rewritten top-down from a one-mark-per-step rubric (owner rule, 11 Nov)."}');
$$\begin{aligned} 350000(1.005)^n - 2998\left(\dfrac{1.005^n - 1}{0.005}\right) &= 0 \\ 350000(1.005)^n - 2998\times 200\left(1.005^n - 1\right) &= 0 \\ (350000 - 2998\times 200)\,1.005^n &= -2998\times 200 \\ 1.005^n &= \dfrac{1499}{624} \\ n &= \log_{1.005}\left(\dfrac{1499}{624}\right) \\ n &= 175.72 \end{aligned}$$
$\therefore$ The loan is repaid after $176$ more months.','1: equation $A_n = 0$ with $350000$ and $2998$; 1: $n = \log_{1.005}\left(\dfrac{1499}{624}\right)$',409,NULL,'parse-v1',NULL,NULL,'[[2, "Correct answer"], [1, "Forms the equation $A_n=0$ with $350000$ and $2998$, or equivalent merit"]]','{"top_criterion_original": "$n = \\log_{1.005}\\left(\\dfrac{1499}{624}\\right)$", "criteria_original": [[1, "Equation $A_n = 0$ with $350000$ and $2998$"], [1, "Correct answer"]], "rubric_note": "Rewritten top-down from a one-mark-per-step rubric (owner rule, 11 Nov)."}');
