$$\begin{aligned}\text{Sum}&=a+(n-1)d+a+(n-2)d+a+(n-3)d+\ldots+a+(n-30)d\\&=30a+30dn-d(1+2+3+\ldots+30)\\&=30a+30dn-d\times\dfrac{30}{2}(1+30)\\&=30a+30dn-465d\\-1980&=30\times 856+30\times(-4)n-465(-4)\\-1980&=27540-120n\\120n&=29520\\n&=246\end{aligned}$$','3: Correct solution; 2: Writes a correct simplified expression (algebraic or numeric) for the sum of the last 30 terms; 1: Finds the correct value for $a$, or equivalent merit',1356,NULL,'parse-v1',NULL,NULL,'[[3, "Correct answer"], [2, "Writes a correct simplified expression (algebraic or numeric) for the sum of the last 30 terms, or equivalent merit"], [1, "Finds the correct value for $a$, or equivalent merit"]]','{"criteria_original": [[3, "Correct solution"], [2, "Writes a correct simplified expression (algebraic or numeric) for the sum of the last 30 terms"], [1, "Finds the correct value for $a$, or equivalent merit"]], "top_criterion_original": "Correct solution"}');

Let $A_n$ be the amount owing after the $n^{\text{th}}$ month.
$$\begin{aligned}A_1&=1.007\times 820000-6248\\A_2&=1.007\times A_1-6248\\&=1.007\times(1.007\times 820000-6248)-6248\\&=1.007^2\times 820000-1.007\times 6248-6248\\A_3&=1.007\times A_2-6248\\&=1.007\times(1.007^2\times 820000-1.007\times 6248-6248)-6248\\&=1.007^3\times 820000-1.007^2\times 6248-1.007\times 6248-6248\\&\ \ \vdots\\A_n&=1.007^n\times 820000-1.007^{n-1}\times 6248-1.007^{n-2}\times 6248-\ldots-1.007^2\times 6248-1.007\times 6248-6248\\A_{120}&=1.007^{120}\times 820000-\underbrace{1.007^{119}\times 6248-1.007^{118}\times 6248-\ldots-1.007^2\times 6248-1.007\times 6248-6248}_{\text{GP where } a=6248,\ r=1.007,\ n=120,\ S_n=\frac{a(r^n-1)}{r-1}}\\&=1.007^{120}\times 820000-\dfrac{6248(1.007^{120}-1)}{1.007-1}\\&=724960.5746\\&=\$724960.57\end{aligned}$$','3: Correct solution; 2: Writes an expression for $A_{120}$; 1: Establishes a pattern and writes an expression for $A_2$',1356,NULL,'parse-v1',NULL,NULL,'[[3, "Correct answer"], [2, "Writes an expression for $A_{120}$, or equivalent merit"], [1, "Establishes a pattern and writes an expression for $A_2$, or equivalent merit"]]','{"criteria_original": [[3, "Correct solution"], [2, "Writes an expression for $A_{120}$"], [1, "Establishes a pattern and writes an expression for $A_2$"]], "top_criterion_original": "Correct solution"}');

After $n$ more months the amount owing is
$$A_n=1.007^n\times 720000-M-M\times 1.007-M\times 1.007^2-\ldots-M\times 1.007^{n-1}$$
The repayments form a GP with first term $M$ and ratio $1.007$, and the loan is repaid when $A_{180}=0$:
$$\begin{aligned}0&=1.007^{180}\times 720000-\dfrac{M(1.007^{180}-1)}{1.007-1}\\0&=1.007^{180}\times 720000-\dfrac{M(1.007^{180}-1)}{0.007}\\1.007^{180}\times 720000&=\dfrac{M(1.007^{180}-1)}{0.007}\\1.007^{180}\times 720000\times 0.007&=M(1.007^{180}-1)\\M&=\dfrac{1.007^{180}\times 720000\times 0.007}{1.007^{180}-1}\\&=7047.983754\\&=\$7047.98\end{aligned}$$','2: Correct solution; 1: Writes an expression to find the monthly repayment',1356,NULL,'parse-v1',NULL,NULL,'[[2, "Correct answer"], [1, "Writes an expression to find the monthly repayment, or equivalent merit"]]','{"criteria_original": [[2, "Correct solution"], [1, "Writes an expression to find the monthly repayment"]], "top_criterion_original": "Correct solution"}');
