$$\begin{aligned} \dfrac{d}{dx}\left(\sin^3x\right)&=3\cos x-3\cos^3x\\ \therefore\ \cos^3x&=\cos x-\dfrac{1}{3}\left[\dfrac{d}{dx}\left(\sin^3x\right)\right] \end{aligned}$$
$$\begin{aligned} \int_0^{\frac{\pi}{6}}\cos^3x\,dx&=\int_0^{\frac{\pi}{6}}\left(\cos x-\dfrac{1}{3}\left[\dfrac{d}{dx}\left(\sin^3x\right)\right]\right)dx\\ &=\int_0^{\frac{\pi}{6}}\cos x\,dx-\dfrac{1}{3}\int_0^{\frac{\pi}{6}}\left[\dfrac{d}{dx}\left(\sin^3x\right)\right]dx\\ &=\Big[\sin x\Big]_0^{\frac{\pi}{6}}-\dfrac{1}{3}\Big[\sin^3x\Big]_0^{\frac{\pi}{6}}\\ &=\sin\left(\dfrac{\pi}{6}\right)-\sin(0)-\dfrac{1}{3}\left(\sin^3\left(\dfrac{\pi}{6}\right)-\sin^3(0)\right)\\ &=\dfrac{1}{2}-0-\dfrac{1}{3}\left(\dfrac{1}{8}-0\right)\\ &=\dfrac{11}{24} \end{aligned}$$','2: Provides correct solution; 1: Correctly rearranges the answer to part a to integrate',1361,NULL,'parse-v1',NULL,NULL,'[[2, "Correct answer"], [1, "Correctly rearranges the answer to part (a) to integrate, or equivalent merit"]]','{"criteria_original": [[2, "Provides correct solution"], [1, "Correctly rearranges the answer to part a to integrate"]], "top_criterion_original": "Provides correct solution"}');
