$$\begin{aligned} T_n&=3n^2-4n-\left[3(n-1)^2-4(n-1)\right]\\ &=3n^2-4n-3(n^2-2n+1)+4(n-1)\\ &=3n^2-4n-3n^2+6n-3+4n-4\\ &=6n-7 \end{aligned}$$
$$T_1=6-7=-1,\quad T_2=12-7=5,\quad T_3=18-7=11$$
$$d=11-5=5-(-1)$$
$$\therefore\ d=6$$
