$$\begin{aligned}u&=\sqrt{x}=x^{\frac{1}{2}} & v&=e^x\\u''&=\dfrac{1}{2}x^{-\frac{1}{2}}=\dfrac{1}{2\sqrt{x}} & v''&=e^x\end{aligned}$$
