$$\begin{aligned}h_1''(16)&=\left(\dfrac{\pi}{24}\right)10\cos\left(\dfrac{\pi}{24}(16-12)\right)\\&=\left(\dfrac{\pi}{24}\right)10\cos\left(\dfrac{\pi}{6}\right)\\&=\left(\dfrac{\pi}{24}\right)10\left(\dfrac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right)\\&=\dfrac{5\sqrt{3}}{24}\pi\end{aligned}$$
