Standardising with $\sigma=1.6$:
$$\begin{aligned}x&=8.5: & z&=\dfrac{8.5-5.73}{1.6}\approx 1.73\\x&=5.5: & z&=\dfrac{5.5-5.73}{1.6}\approx -0.14\end{aligned}$$
By symmetry, $P(Z<-0.14)=1-P(Z<0.14)$:
