$$\begin{aligned}f(t)&=36kt-kt^3\\ &=\dfrac{t}{9}-\dfrac{t^3}{324}\\ f''(t)&=\dfrac{1}{9}-\dfrac{3t^2}{324}\end{aligned}$$
Stationary points when $f''(t)=0$:
$$\begin{aligned}0&=\dfrac{1}{9}-\dfrac{3t^2}{324}\\ \dfrac{3t^2}{324}&=\dfrac{1}{9}\\ t^2&=12\\ t&=\sqrt{12}\quad(t>0)\\ &=2\sqrt{3}\end{aligned}$$
Checking the nature:
$$\begin{aligned}f''''(t)&=-\dfrac{6t}{324}\\ f''''(2\sqrt{3})&=-\dfrac{\sqrt{3}}{27}\end{aligned}$$
$f''''(2\sqrt{3})<0$, so there is a maximum at $t=2\sqrt{3}$.

$\therefore$ the mode is $2\sqrt{3}$ minutes.','1: $t=2\sqrt{3}$; 1: checks nature to show a maximum (must show for 2/2)',166,NULL,'parse-v1',NULL,NULL,'[[2, "Correct answer"], [1, "Finds $t=2\\sqrt{3}$, or equivalent merit"]]','{"criteria_original": [[1, "$t=2\\sqrt{3}$"], [1, "checks nature to show a maximum (must show for 2/2)"]], "top_criterion_original": "checks nature to show a maximum (must show for 2/2)", "marker_note": "The nature must be checked to show a maximum for 2 marks."}');
$$\begin{aligned}P(X>3\,|\,X\ge 1)&=\dfrac{P(X>3)}{P(X\ge 1)}\\ &=\dfrac{1-P(X\le 3)}{1-P(X<1)}\end{aligned}$$
With $f(t)=\dfrac{t}{9}-\dfrac{t^3}{324}$:
$$\begin{aligned}P(X<3)&=\int_0^3\left(\dfrac{t}{9}-\dfrac{t^3}{324}\right)dt\\ &=\left[\dfrac{t^2}{18}-\dfrac{t^4}{1296}\right]_0^3\\ &=\dfrac{3^2}{18}-\dfrac{3^4}{1296}-0\\ &=\dfrac{7}{16}\end{aligned}$$
$$\begin{aligned}P(X<1)&=\int_0^1\left(\dfrac{t}{9}-\dfrac{t^3}{324}\right)dt\\ &=\left[\dfrac{t^2}{18}-\dfrac{t^4}{1296}\right]_0^1\\ &=\dfrac{1^2}{18}-\dfrac{1^4}{1296}-0\\ &=\dfrac{71}{1296}\end{aligned}$$
$$\begin{aligned}\therefore\ P(X>3\,|\,X\ge 1)&=\dfrac{1-\frac{7}{16}}{1-\frac{71}{1296}}\\ &=\dfrac{729}{1225}\end{aligned}$$','1: conditional probability set up; 1: $P(X<3)=\dfrac{7}{16}$ or $P(X<1)=\dfrac{71}{1296}$ (either); 1: $\dfrac{729}{1225}$',166,NULL,'parse-v1',NULL,NULL,'[[3, "Correct answer"], [2, "Finds $P(X<3)=\\dfrac{7}{16}$ or $P(X<1)=\\dfrac{71}{1296}$, or equivalent merit"], [1, "Sets up the conditional probability, or equivalent merit"]]','{"criteria_original": [[1, "conditional probability set up"], [1, "$P(X<3)=\\dfrac{7}{16}$ or $P(X<1)=\\dfrac{71}{1296}$ (either)"], [1, "$\\dfrac{729}{1225}$"]], "top_criterion_original": "$\\dfrac{729}{1225}$", "source_original": "$\\left[\\dfrac{t^2}{18}-\\dfrac{t^4}{324}\\right]_0^3=\\dfrac{3^2}{18}-\\dfrac{3^4}{324}-0$ (same for $[\\ ]_0^1$); $\\therefore\\ P(X>3\\,|\\,X<1)=\\dfrac{1-\\frac{7}{16}}{1-\\frac{71}{1296}}=\\dfrac{729}{1225}$", "corrected": "Corrected from source: the primitive of $\\dfrac{t^3}{324}$ was written $\\dfrac{t^4}{324}$; it is $\\dfrac{t^4}{1296}$ (the values $\\dfrac{7}{16}$ and $\\dfrac{71}{1296}$ already use 1296), and the last line''s condition $X<1$ is $X\\ge 1$. Answer unchanged."}');
