$$\begin{aligned} x-2&\ne0 &&\text{so } x\ne2\\ \dfrac{1}{x-2}&\ne0 &&\text{so } h(x)\ne3 \end{aligned}$$
$\therefore$ Domain: $(-\infty,2)\cup(2,\infty)$

