$$\begin{aligned} \text{Distance}&=\int_0^1\left(3t^2-12t+9\right)dt+\left|\int_1^3\left(3t^2-12t+9\right)dt\right| \\ &=\Big[t^3-6t^2+9t\Big]_0^1+\left|\Big[t^3-6t^2+9t\Big]_1^3\right| \\ &=(1-6+9)-(0)+\Big|(27-54+27)-(1-6+9)\Big| \\ &=4+|-4| \\ &=8 \text{ metres} \end{aligned}$$','3: correct answer; 2: correct evaluation of both integrals; 1: correct integral expression split at t = 1',373,NULL,'parse-v1',NULL,NULL,'[[3, "Correct answer"], [2, "Correct evaluation of both integrals, or equivalent merit"], [1, "Correct integral expression split at $t=1$, or equivalent merit"]]','{"criteria_original": [[3, "correct answer"], [2, "correct evaluation of both integrals"], [1, "correct integral expression split at t = 1"]]}');

