$$\therefore V=1000\ln|1+t|-500t+1000\left(\ln\dfrac{5}{36}+3\right)$$','1: correct primitive; 1: V(4) = 2V(5) used correctly; 1: C found; 1: correct expression for V',373,NULL,'parse-v1',NULL,NULL,'[[4, "Correct answer"], [3, "Finds $C$, or equivalent merit"], [2, "Uses $V(4)=2V(5)$ correctly, or equivalent merit"], [1, "Correct primitive, or equivalent merit"]]','{"criteria_original": [[1, "correct primitive"], [1, "V(4) = 2V(5) used correctly"], [1, "C found"], [1, "correct expression for V"]], "top_criterion_original": "correct expression for V"}');
